diff --git a/CHANGELOG.txt b/CHANGELOG.txt
index be9d47c1..f2cd6276 100755
--- a/CHANGELOG.txt
+++ b/CHANGELOG.txt
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@ CHANGELOG
 
 2.1.64
 UTIL:
+* type=vendor-migration | the 3rd party parsers are not part of pan-os-php any more (removed: migration/, utils/develop/migration/, utils/develop/migration_playbook.php; Docker images without them): they come from a migration plug-in - a licensed package per vendor family (PANOSPHP_PLUGIN_PACKAGES=<file>.ppp[:…] + PANOSPHP_LICENSE) or a folder (PANOSPHP_MIGRATION_PARSERS=<parser folder>[,<folder>]). A parser root holds vendors.php (vendor => file, class, title); PH::migrationRoots / migrationFile / migrationVendors / migrationLoad. Without a plug-in the type says what is missing. The base configurations moved to lib/resources/baseconfig/ (type=threat / application without in=, type=upload)
 * config-viewer | docs/0-installation.md: installation on macOS and Windows - Docker as the one requirement; Docker Desktop (licence note) or without it: Colima + Docker CLI (macOS), Docker Engine in WSL 2 Ubuntu (Windows); check of Docker, then install-viewer.sh; also a help page of the login page
 * filter | (object is.missconfigured): service - the name says the other protocol (/udp/i with protocol tcp, /tcp/i with protocol udp; a name with both is not checked); address - the name names another IPv4 value than the object (ip-netmask: address and prefix - /24 _24 -24 or the dotted netmask -, ip-range: start / end, an IPv4 address in the name of an fqdn / ip-wildcard object)
 * config-viewer | predefined objects (services, applications, EDLs, regions, profiles, …) only at the locations "predefined" and "any" - at "shared" only the objects of the configuration (the CLI lists them at shared too, unchanged)
